  "Intuitive Attachment Process for Customers": "Intuitiv tilknytningsproces for kunder",
  "Designed with user experience in mind, the Checkout Attachment Module makes adding attachments a straightforward and hassle-free process. During checkout, customers are presented with an easy-to-use interface to upload their files. Supported file types and size limits can be configured to suit your business needs, ensuring compatibility and efficiency. This user-friendly approach helps reduce friction in the checkout process, leading to higher customer satisfaction and fewer order discrepancies.": "Checkout Attachment Module er designet med brugeroplevelse i tankerne og gør tilføjelse af vedhæftede filer til en ligetil og problemfri proces. ",
